  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KfW Heating system Kosovo - KfW, Kosovo heating system</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KfW, Utveckling av fj&#xe4;rrv&#xe4;rme Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra fj&#xe4;rrv&#xe4;rmesystemet i Pristina     genom att koppla kraftverket Kosovo B till v&#xe4;rmesystemet i Pristina.  Detta &#xe4;r ett milj&#xf6;v&#xe4;nligt och ekonomiskt effektivit s&#xe4;tt att anv&#xe4;nda  Kosovo B och f&#xe5; v&#xe4;rme till Kosovos huvudstad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is through a co-generation project to improve the efficiency  of the heating system in Kosovo. This is an environmental and cost    efficient way to use the Kosovo B power plant for heating needs in    Kosovo.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2022; Reduction of the operative cost of the district heating company Prishtina by around 50%.&#x2022; Full replacement of heavy oil by steam of the power plant Kosovo B, i.e.&#x2022; large reduction of pollution and CO2 emissions (by 60,000 tons p.a.) by reducing the loss of heat and water and increasing the energy efficiency.&#x2022; Significant reduction of electricity demand from households for heating, thereby substantial decrease of electricity shortfall of Kosovo.&#x2022; Improvement of the supply for the consumers with heat from the district heating network.&#x2022; Institutional strengthening of the district heat provider.</narrative>
  </description>
